177
00:07:19,820 --> 00:07:21,820
For me it's Wu-Tang, of course...

178
00:07:21,820 --> 00:07:22,820
Okay, for me it's Mobb Deep .

179
00:07:22,820 --> 00:07:24,820
But yeah, ok, ok.

180
00:07:24,820 --> 00:07:27,820
