long, man.

201
00:08:19,400 --> 00:08:20,440
Make a splash, you know?

202
00:08:20,440 --> 00:08:22,720
Yeah, make something happen.

203
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:28,160
I was still a bit removed from the scene,

204
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:31,680
