226
00:09:18,760 --> 00:09:20,260
Not the Andrei we mentioned earlier!

227
00:09:20,260 --> 00:09:21,260
No, no, no.

228
00:09:21,260 --> 00:09:23,760
It has nothing to do with rap though.

229
00:09:23,760 --> 00:09:24,760
Yes.

230
00:09:24,760 --> 00:09:26,260
Nothing. He was just a friend of mine,

231
00:09:26,260 --> 00:09:29,260
