233
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:34,160
He sent, "Hey, let's do it!"

234
00:09:34,160 --> 00:09:34,960
Ok, ok.

235
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:37,460
It felt good as a reference to a good friend
of mine.

236
00:09:37,460 --> 00:09:38,060
Nice.

237
00:09:38,060 --> 00:09:39,060
So, next.

238
00:09:39,060 --> 00:09:39,760
"Dafni."

239
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:41,560
