776
00:34:34,244 --> 00:34:37,380
There were those who wanted everything and
gave you nothing back.

777
00:34:37,380 --> 00:34:42,717
I expect nothing now. Everything I did was
intense. However much I drank, they caught me;
I kept messing up.

778
00:34:42,717 --> 00:34:49,523
I tormented myself alone at dawn, always a
target for others. Everywhere I went,
commotion. You've worn us out more than the
South.

779
00:34:49,523 --> 00:34:51,791
Some called it the beginning of the end;
others never did it again.

780
00:34:51,791 --> 00:34:54,793
Others marked souls, spitting through their
verses.

781
00:34:54,800 --> 00:34:56,800
Everyone knows first-hand what Giannis will
bring.

782
00:34:56,800 --> 00:34:58,800
He'll make it, while they drink theirs hot.
[unclear]

783
00:34:58,800 --> 00:35:01,800
I call it an alliance between demons and
angels.

784
00:35:01,800 --> 00:35:03,800
I switch on the mic and bring an explosion.

785
00:35:03,800 --> 00:35:05,800
Bars pouring down like torrents. Welcome,

786
00:35:05,800 --> 00:35:07,800
all believers—your places have been kept for
you.

787
00:35:07,800 --> 00:35:09,800
I come in with a clear conscience,

788
00:35:09,800 --> 00:35:11,340
loaded with horsepower.

789
00:35:11,340 --> 00:35:13,220
I'm not negotiating anything anymore,

790
00:35:13,220 --> 00:35:14,720
not even halfway.

791
00:35:14,720 --> 00:35:16,200
I know the cost, years on the job,

792
00:35:16,200 --> 00:35:17,380
always expendable in rap.

793
00:35:17,380 --> 00:35:18,920
I raise the exposure so they find their light,

794
00:35:18,920 --> 00:35:20,920
and do magic without drugs.

795
00:35:20,920 --> 00:35:22,480
I sprint, though they see me calm.

796
00:35:22,480 --> 00:35:24,480
When I get on the mic, stadium drums kick in,

797
00:35:24,480 --> 00:35:26,720
like the World Cup. Like Jack, I disappear
into the shadows.

798
00:35:26,720 --> 00:35:28,440
I don't owe what I feel anymore.

799
00:35:28,440 --> 00:35:31,440
I don't ask for salvation when I burn, lost in
space and time.

800
00:35:31,440 --> 00:35:34,440
We keep leaving and returning; I see the
deception.

801
00:35:34,440 --> 00:35:37,440
No need to help, now I'm back at this tempo.

802
00:35:37,440 --> 00:35:39,440
Rappers will need a translator.

803
00:35:39,440 --> 00:35:42,440
I'm no gangster or dealer, and I didn't come
out of Compton.

804
00:35:42,440 --> 00:35:45,440
I live in the city of flames, in darkness with
orcs. Call it Mordor.

805
00:35:45,440 --> 00:35:48,440
I climb so many levels, the straight paths
disappear.

806
00:35:48,440 --> 00:35:51,240
After studio sessions, red-and-white tapes
come out.

807
00:35:51,240 --> 00:35:53,640
Everyone's waiting for something, and that's
Rap Sta Bam.

808
00:35:53,640 --> 00:35:56,040
Everything's all right; they jump around
together and stare ironically.

809
00:35:56,040 --> 00:35:58,040
Dial at the limit—they don't want to look. I'm
flying.

810
00:35:58,040 --> 00:35:59,640
A lot is coming, and everything's up in the
air.

811
00:35:59,640 --> 00:36:01,240
They'll burn it all, like a stadium stand.

812
00:36:01,240 --> 00:36:02,840
Blue eyes and bloodied guts.

813
00:36:02,840 --> 00:36:17,120
See you at Fight Club, all strapped up.

814
00:36:30,720 --> 00:36:33,520
- What? - Setbacks happen, guys. It's all
good.

815
00:36:33,600 --> 00:36:36,680
Thanks a lot for coming, Giannis.

816
00:36:36,760 --> 00:36:37,842
Shout-out to Nesom

817
00:36:37,842 --> 00:36:38,931
and what you heard.

818
00:36:38,931 --> 00:36:39,960
See you next time.
